	(text "FujiNet-Astrocade Rev0 cart bus.  26-contact single-sided edge (1x26, 0.100in),\npinout per Jay Tilton / MCM Design (ballyalley.com): 13 addr + 8 data + /CCS + 5V + 3x GND.\nConsole is read-only: U7 drives D0-7 only while /CCS low (OE gated by the 5V signal, LVC245 5V-tolerant).\nU8/U9 translate 5V addr+enable down to 3V3 (always enabled, B->A).\nFirmware map (astrocade_cart.h): GP0-12=A0-12, GP13=/ENABLE, GP14-21=D0-7,\nGP22 selftest, GP25 LED, GP26 console-5V sense (100k/100k), GP27 debug TX.\nSW1 RESET (top of cart) pulls RP RUN + S3 EN via D8. SW2+R20 = BOOTSEL (as Pico).\nQ2/Q3: ESP32-S3 GPIO4/GPIO5 force RUN / QSPI_SS for PICOBOOT recovery (as INTV Rev0)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 40.64 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left))
		(uuid "87e37c9c-7a51-536b-87eb-b52053f7f339")
	)
